tions. The commissioner may also use land within the right-of-way of any state highway or other public roadway for the erection of traffic-control devices, other signs, and passenger shelters upon the conditions stated in this subdivision and subject to the express provisions of other applicable statutes and to federal requirements where necessary to qualify for federal aid.

